Using Convex 1.44.0, the backend needs an action processWithNode and a query health returning "ok". Dependencies and generated files are ready. This helper is shared; each option supplies the remaining modules.

convex/nodeHelper.ts
```ts
"use node";
import { createHash } from "node:crypto";
import { posix } from "node:path";
export function processData(data: string) {
  return { hash: createHash("sha256").update(data).digest("hex"),
    normalizedPath: posix.normalize("/some/test/path") };
}
```

